# Animations a tutorial encodes while rendering. Generated from a
# committed mesh, so the source of truth is in git and the artifact is
# not.
packages/pyapprox-tutorials/tutorials/library/*.mp4
# Stills a tutorial writes beside its animation, and any other image a
# render drops in the tutorial directory. Committed artwork lives in
# library/assets/, which this does not match --- the pattern has no
# slash, so it applies to that one directory and not below it.
packages/pyapprox-tutorials/tutorials/library/*.png
